{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09899","headline":"奉送李宾客荆南迎亲 · 岑参","name":"奉送李宾客荆南迎亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迎亲辞旧苑，恩诏下储闱。\n昨见双鱼去，今看驷马归。\n驿帆湘水阔，客舍楚山稀。\n手把黄香扇，身披莱子衣。\n鹊随金印喜，乌傍板舆飞。\n胜作东征赋，还家满路辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}